# Agent Ownership

Route work through `.cursor/agents/orchestrator.md`.

Primary ownership:

- Runtime Storage Agent: persistence hooks in `app/screaner_b_o.py`, `app/storage/*`, storage-related `deploy/*`.
- Schema Contract Agent: `app/schema/*`, `docs/storage-contract.md`, `docs/data-format-*.md`.
- Validation Agent: storage checks in `validation/*`, VPS acceptance evidence and runbooks.
- Model Simulator Agent: `model.ipynb`, model modules, gear meaning in `docs/strategy-gears.md`.
- Integration Validator Agent: independent model regression; does not implement the feature.
- Review Critic Agent: independent design/patch review; does not implement the patch.
- B Stub Runtime Agent: `app/bot/**` except `app/bot/private/**`, live async stub bot, `/data/bbot` ledger.
- B Stub Validator Agent: stub isolation vs D; does not implement.
- B Private Runtime Agent: `app/bot/private/**` only; testnet then live send.
- B Private Validator Agent: venue, secrets, D isolation; does not implement.
- Text Stylist Agent: wording and structure in `docs/*`; does not alter technical meaning.

Rules:

- One implementing agent owns a file during an implementation stage.
- Review and validation agents do not silently repair the patch they assess.
- Schema changes flow Schema Contract → Runtime Storage → Validation → model smoke when applicable.
- Model changes flow Model Simulator → Integration Validator.
- Storage changes flow Runtime Storage → Review Critic → Validation.
- Shared docs require a single semantic owner; Text Stylist runs only after meaning is fixed.
- Frozen ingest, parsing, spread calculation, and live order routing require explicit user approval.
- Track 3 stub-only live bot: B Stub Runtime implements `app/bot/**` except `private/`; Model Simulator owns portable policy; Runtime Storage may own only `spread-bbot.service` and `/data/bbot` paths. No private APIs in the collector, no writes into D trees.
- Track 3 B-private (unlock 2026-08-18): B Private Runtime owns `app/bot/private/**`. Testnet/demo first. Live send only after testnet evidence and an explicit user phrase. Live risk cap ≈ 100 USD per exchange.
- Host Ops agent (VPS load, extra processes, bot logs vs host) is deferred until the first live (non-testnet) order in B-private. Do not create it for stub or testnet.
